      "content": "Hey, i'm prepping for a meeting with some local reps about those new carbon emission standards coming down the line. I need to make a strong case for our company. can you put together a list of the main economic and operational arguments against these new regulations? i need some solid points to show how it's gonna hit mid-sized manufacturers like us.",
